{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review NHS care for women experiencing miscarriage",
        "additional_details": "We think women experiencing pain or bleeding should have a clear pathway including HCG blood tests and results guiding the next step. Women can be left waiting for appointments/scans or told there is no one available at weekends. \r\n \r\nMiscarriage can affect mental health enormously. Please review the system and give women faster answers, better support and more compassionate care.",
        "background": "We want the government to review NHS care for women experiencing miscarriage. I've had 7 miscarriages and I'm fighting for answers. I've experienced miscarriages, ectopic pregnancy, surgery and devastating uncertainty.",
